      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It is understandable that these intense bodily sensations seem overwhelming, though hearing wall humidity or seeing heat glows in pitch-black rooms is not currently supported by scientific evidence of human sensory evolution. When you feel a persistent sense of pressure or bizarre perceptions like this, it is important to prioritize your safety and well-being over trying to interpret them as mysterious upgrades. I strongly encourage you to reach out to a mental health professional who can provide compassionate support and a safe space to discuss these experiences.",
